414
00:31:40,675 --> 00:31:42,084
I don't wanna die...

415
00:31:42,084 --> 00:31:44,174
- I don't wanna die! - I'm going fucking crazy...

416
00:31:44,254 --> 00:31:46,834
Fuck, you know how much I pay this country in taxes?

417
00:31:46,834 --> 00:31:49,134
But they won't save me?

418
00:31:50,134 --> 00:31:54,084
There is one way that we can be saved.

419
00:31:54,464 --> 00:31:55,794
