432
00:32:24,834 --> 00:32:26,964
You must be a professor.

433
00:32:27,084 --> 00:32:28,754
Then where did he go?

434
00:32:28,794 --> 00:32:32,084
I saw him follow Kang into the room.

435
00:32:32,294 --> 00:32:33,924
So what are we supposed to do?

436
00:32:34,254 --> 00:32:36,004
We can't even set foot outside this door!

437
00:32:36,004 --> 00:32:39,585
Go up to the 3rd floor? How can we make it there?

438
00:32:39,675 --> 00:32:40,794
Right...

439
00:32:41,334 --> 00:32:42,754
Those people out there

440
00:32:43,334 --> 00:32:46,134
seem to be evolving through information exchange.

441
00:32:46,505 --> 00:32:48,384
First they walked on all fours,

442
00:32:48,585 --> 00:32:50,294
and charged at signs.

443
00:32:50,924 --> 00:32:52,294
Now they walk on two feet

444
00:32:53,004 --> 00:32:55,044
and their ability to identify humans

445
00:32:55,044 --> 00:32:56,585
is slowly taking shape.

446
