478
00:34:20,924 --> 00:34:22,884
Who's gonna do that?

479
00:34:23,335 --> 00:34:24,425
I'll do it.

480
00:34:25,335 --> 00:34:27,004
You'll fail, 100%.

481
00:34:27,635 --> 00:34:30,834
Look, how about someone more fit?

482
00:34:31,465 --> 00:34:32,924
