493
00:35:05,715 --> 00:35:06,884
Here.

494
00:35:07,084 --> 00:35:08,425
- Here? - Yeah.

495
00:35:08,425 --> 00:35:11,004
I added you all to a group chat, so check it.

496
00:35:11,675 --> 00:35:15,295
If they're exchanging information, we should do it, too.

497
00:35:32,134 --> 00:35:34,545
Bring back this same perfume.

498
00:35:44,635 --> 00:35:47,134
Hey, you nutjobs!

499
00:35:47,715 --> 00:35:49,004
Come and get me!

500
00:37:13,004 --> 00:37:14,134
Hurry!

501
00:37:14,505 --> 00:37:16,134
Close the door!

502
00:37:17,794 --> 00:37:19,425
I got them. Here.

503
00:37:31,924 --> 00:37:32,044
Thal antifreeze, bring it here

504
00:37:32,044 --> 00:37:33,295
That antifreeze, bring it here!

505
00:37:33,295 --> 00:37:34,425
Antifreeze, okay!

506
00:37:39,135 --> 00:37:39,924
Here.

507
00:37:39,964 --> 00:37:41,044
That stinks!

508
00:37:41,175 --> 00:37:43,004
Why does this smell so strong?

509
00:38:03,385 --> 00:38:04,715
Ready? - Yeah.

510
00:40:14,715 --> 00:40:16,175
We can go now.

511
00:40:36,005 --> 00:40:36,794
Hurry up!

512
00:40:38,884 --> 00:40:40,085
Let's just go!

513
00:40:43,834 --> 00:40:44,965
What are you doing?

514
00:40:47,585 --> 00:40:49,425
Does anyone have a lighter?

515
00:41:19,505 --> 00:41:20,425
Hurry, run!

516
00:41:21,965 --> 00:41:23,085
Behind us!

517
00:41:44,505 --> 00:41:45,545
Run, quickly!

518
00:41:50,635 --> 00:41:51,675
Hold on tight.

519
00:42:12,005 --> 00:42:12,925
Look out!

520
00:42:51,505 --> 00:42:53,754
How did a world-renowned scientist

521
00:42:53,754 --> 00:42:56,465
become a terrorist threating the nation?

522
00:42:56,675 --> 00:42:59,675
Let's look into the background of Dr. Suh Young-chul.

523
00:42:59,794 --> 00:43:01,585
He was top-ranked at his university

524
00:43:01,635 --> 00:43:03,175
from entrance to graduation,

525
00:43:03,385 --> 00:43:06,675
and his graduation thesis "Biocomputing With Fungi"

526
00:43:06,835 --> 00:43:09,425
was published in the journal Science.

527
00:43:09,635 --> 00:43:12,047
For such a promising talent

528
00:43:12,047 --> 00:43:13,247
to suddenly commit terrorism

529
00:43:13,247 --> 00:43:14,447
and hold the nation hostage,

530
00:43:14,447 --> 00:43:16,490
it's quite hard to understand.

531
00:43:16,690 --> 00:43:17,533
Reporter Kim Seong-il,

532
00:43:17,533 --> 00:43:19,516
are there any notable details

533
00:43:19,516 --> 00:43:21,239
concerning Suh Young-chul ?

534
00:43:21,439 --> 00:43:24,935
Suh's father was a professor of Applied Biology

535
00:43:24,935 --> 00:43:27,205
at Seocheong University.

536
00:43:27,205 --> 00:43:28,337
PROF. SUH DENIES MISUSE OF RESEARCH FUNDS
While he was there,

537
00:43:28,337 --> 00:43:31,139
PROF. SUH DENIES MISUSE OF RESEARCH FUNDS
an anonymous tip led to an internal report

538
00:43:31,139 --> 00:43:33,504
on misuse of funds for his research lab

539
00:43:33,504 --> 00:43:35,546
and exploitation of student researchers,

540
00:43:35,546 --> 00:43:37,498
and this was widely covered in the press.

541
00:43:37,498 --> 00:43:39,666
Four weeks after the report

542
00:43:39,666 --> 00:43:42,341
Professor Suh chose to end his own life.

543
00:43:42,341 --> 00:43:44,615
Is there any link between this incident

544
00:43:44,615 --> 00:43:47,019
and Suh Young-chul's terrorist attack ?

545
00:43:47,219 --> 00:43:50,175
Could it be some sort of revenge?

546
00:43:50,505 --> 00:43:53,925
So far, Suh has not made any requests or demands,

547
00:43:53,965 --> 00:43:57,425
so it seems unlikely that the two incidents are related.

548
00:43:57,505 --> 00:44:00,045
At the moment, the government has not released

549
00:44:00,045 --> 00:44:01,925
