550
00:44:04,005 --> 00:44:05,085
3rd Floor.

551
00:44:15,335 --> 00:44:16,335
No one here.

552
00:44:16,385 --> 00:44:17,215
Hurry!

553
00:44:46,465 --> 00:44:48,085
Suh Young-chul, you are under arrest

554
00:44:48,135 --> 00:44:50,295
for the Doongwoori Building terrorist attack.

555
00:44:50,545 --> 00:44:53,135
You have the right to an attorney,

556
00:44:53,135 --> 00:44:54,965
and the right to remain silent.

557
00:44:55,215 --> 00:44:58,175
Anything you say can and will be used against you in court...

558
00:44:58,175 --> 00:44:59,295
Nice to meet you.

559
00:44:59,716 --> 00:45:02,675
Using water to disrupt their communications network,

560
00:45:03,295 --> 00:45:05,175
that was your idea, Professor Kwon?

561
00:45:05,585 --> 00:45:06,335
What's this?

562
00:45:06,335 --> 00:45:07,755
You two know each other?

563
00:45:07,855 --> 00:45:09,045
But that was a mistake.

564
00:45:11,505 --> 00:45:13,545
Water evaporates quickly.

565
00:45:13,676 --> 00:45:16,425
If water mixes in the air with their network,

566
00:45:16,465 --> 00:45:17,795
won't it work faster?

567
00:45:18,465 --> 00:45:19,335
Forget it.

568
00:45:20,085 --> 00:45:21,175
What now?

569
00:45:21,676 --> 00:45:22,925
Is the rescue team coming?

570
00:45:23,585 --> 00:45:24,425
No.

571
00:45:24,795 --> 00:45:27,045
We have to meet the rescue team on the roof.

572
00:45:27,045 --> 00:45:27,545
What?

573
00:45:27,545 --> 00:45:29,676
The rescue team must not be exposed to the infected.

574
00:45:29,676 --> 00:45:33,465
We almost died coming here, now we have to go to the roof?

575
00:45:33,635 --> 00:45:36,585
Can't the rescue team come down and wipe them all out?

576
00:45:37,295 --> 00:45:38,795
Those people are patients.

577
00:45:39,135 --> 00:45:41,335
We've been ordered not to kill them without reason.

578
00:45:41,385 --> 00:45:42,965
What bullshit!

579
00:45:43,005 --> 00:45:44,676
Those monsters out there are patients?

580
00:45:45,175 --> 00:45:46,795
Do patients kill people?

581
00:45:47,925 --> 00:45:50,795
Damn it, I don't care if they're monsters or whatever.

582
00:45:51,005 --> 00:45:54,045
At any rate, if we can get him up to the roof,

583
00:45:54,175 --> 00:45:57,175
the rescue team will come. Then we can all survive.

584
00:45:57,385 --> 00:46:00,005
We just need to find a safe way to get there.

585
00:46:00,755 --> 00:46:02,425
Is there one?

586
00:46:02,585 --> 00:46:03,585
There is.

587
00:46:03,716 --> 00:46:07,465
There's a cargo elevator that most people don't know about.

588
00:46:09,005 --> 00:46:11,085
That seems safest.

589
00:46:11,755 --> 00:46:13,835
I think that security guard's right.

590
00:46:16,835 --> 00:46:19,545
Alright, let's give it a try.

591
00:46:19,925 --> 00:46:21,676
You take the lead.

592
00:46:25,676 --> 00:46:26,965
Let's go.

593
00:46:28,925 --> 00:46:29,965
You first.

594
00:46:34,755 --> 00:46:35,835
Professor Gong!

595
00:46:40,045 --> 00:46:42,676
You got here quickly.

596
00:46:42,835 --> 00:46:43,676
Yes.

597
00:46:45,045 --> 00:46:46,925
This was Suh Young-chul's research lab?

598
00:46:46,925 --> 00:46:47,586
Yeah.

599
00:46:47,755 --> 00:46:52,676
After leaving Chains Bio, it seems he kept researching here.

600
00:46:53,045 --> 00:46:54,005
Professor Joo!

601
00:46:54,085 --> 00:46:54,965
Yeah.

602
00:46:55,636 --> 00:46:58,676
Say hello. This is Myunghan University Biotechnology

603
00:46:58,716 --> 00:47:00,135
Professor Gong Sul-hee.

604
00:47:00,965 --> 00:47:03,545
These are professors Lee Hyeon-myeong and Jo Hyeon-mi.

605
00:47:03,545 --> 00:47:05,505
So the government has assembled

606
00:47:05,545 --> 00:47:07,586
this special investigative team.

607
00:47:07,586 --> 00:47:10,335
When the SWAT team goes in, we'll join them,

608
00:47:10,586 --> 00:47:12,215
so prepare yourself, Professor Gong.

609
00:47:12,215 --> 00:47:13,465
Understood.

610
00:47:14,215 --> 00:47:15,835
Alpha Team take the front door,

611
00:47:15,885 --> 00:47:17,586
Delta Team enter from the back.

612
00:47:35,005 --> 00:47:36,045
Shit...

613
00:47:36,716 --> 00:47:38,085
I'm gonna do it.

614
00:47:38,335 --> 00:47:39,546
I'm pushing it.

615
00:47:50,295 --> 00:47:51,636
Hurry up!

616
00:47:52,546 --> 00:47:53,755
Hurry!

617
00:47:54,755 --> 00:47:56,215
Close the door, quick!

618
00:48:01,755 --> 00:48:03,135
Going up.

619
00:48:05,425 --> 00:48:07,835
We'll be on the roof in 5 minutes.

620
00:48:11,135 --> 00:48:12,676
How old are you?

621
00:48:13,586 --> 00:48:15,506
You're in great shape for your age.

622
00:48:16,636 --> 00:48:18,586
The way you slid back there was so cool.

623
00:48:19,506 --> 00:48:20,965
You were so fast.

624
00:48:21,676 --> 00:48:22,546
Like this.

625
00:48:25,885 --> 00:48:26,795
The doors are opening.

626
00:48:44,586 --> 00:48:45,385
No!

627
00:49:09,755 --> 00:49:11,135
He got away!

628
00:49:12,586 --> 00:49:14,135
Who cares if he did?

629
00:49:14,636 --> 00:49:17,755
You really think that bastard's more important than us?

630
00:49:17,755 --> 00:49:19,466
That jerk is the vaccine.

631
00:49:19,676 --> 00:49:22,885
You saw it now. The infected didn't even touch him.

632
00:49:23,085 --> 00:49:24,965
We need to take that vaccine out with us!

633
00:49:25,085 --> 00:49:26,255
But...

634
00:49:26,835 --> 00:49:28,835
How are we supposed to bring him out?

635
00:49:28,835 --> 00:49:32,426
You saw how those monsters are swarming all over!

636
00:49:32,965 --> 00:49:35,426
How do we pull him out of there?

637
00:49:36,385 --> 00:49:37,466
The doors are opening.

638
00:49:47,215 --> 00:49:50,755
What? Are those bastards mimicking us?

639
00:49:56,215 --> 00:49:57,835
The doors are closing.

640
00:50:02,295 --> 00:50:03,835
What do we do now?

641
00:50:04,586 --> 00:50:05,835
-Hyun-seok. - Yeah?

642
00:50:05,885 --> 00:50:07,386
Is there a control room where

643
00:50:07,426 --> 00:50:09,335
you can see all the building's CCTVs?

644
00:50:09,335 --> 00:50:10,636
What? A control room?

645
00:50:10,965 --> 00:50:12,965
You should know, you're on the security team.

646
00:50:12,965 --> 00:50:13,546
Yeah.

647
00:50:13,546 --> 00:50:16,586
If we can watch all of the CCTVs,

648
00:50:16,676 --> 00:50:19,676
we can see where he's going in real time.

649
00:50:20,175 --> 00:50:21,676
The control room...

650
00:50:22,755 --> 00:50:24,636
is at the very end of Floor B2.

651
00:50:24,636 --> 00:50:26,215
B2! B2!

652
00:50:26,255 --> 00:50:29,085
For now, let's go there and look for Suh.

653
00:50:41,045 --> 00:50:42,335
Alpha, clear.

654
00:50:43,255 --> 00:50:44,586
Delta, clear.

655
00:50:45,386 --> 00:50:47,755
He's set up an entire lab here.

656
00:51:01,426 --> 00:51:03,255
You should see this over here.

657
00:51:19,426 --> 00:51:22,336
What is this? Are they all dead?

658
00:51:23,085 --> 00:51:24,386
They're alive.

659
00:51:31,215 --> 00:51:33,336
What experiment was he doing?

660
00:51:41,426 --> 00:51:43,676
Here! This one's been opened!

661
00:51:46,546 --> 00:51:47,676
Contact!

662
00:52:30,636 --> 00:52:31,925
SPECIAL OPERATION UNIT

663
00:52:38,755 --> 00:52:39,795
Attack!

664
00:52:40,466 --> 00:52:41,636
Return fire!

665
00:52:42,885 --> 00:52:43,795
Alpha down!

666
00:52:52,085 --> 00:52:53,386
Contact!

667
00:52:54,506 --> 00:52:56,466
Take her to safety!

668
00:53:34,925 --> 00:53:37,636
Targets have stopped moving. Clear, confirming.

669
00:53:38,005 --> 00:53:39,426
Clear, confirming.

670
00:53:44,085 --> 00:53:45,426
They've all stopped.

671
00:53:46,176 --> 00:53:47,636
Each defend your own zone.

672
00:53:47,676 --> 00:53:49,965
In case of danger, respond immediately.

673
00:54:37,256 --> 00:54:37,636
What's that?

674
00:54:38,506 --> 00:54:40,045
That's evolving?

675
00:54:41,296 --> 00:54:43,005
Where's the control room?

676
00:54:43,546 --> 00:54:44,586
That way.

677
00:54:44,636 --> 00:54:46,426
Okay, let's move quietly.

678
00:55:52,965 --> 00:55:54,466
Pull yourself together!

679
00:56:15,256 --> 00:56:16,466
Sit me down here.

680
00:56:16,755 --> 00:56:18,046
Close that.

681
00:56:24,256 --> 00:56:26,506
These are the main cameras.

682
00:56:27,136 --> 00:56:28,546
And for the auxiliary cams...

683
00:56:28,586 --> 00:56:29,506
CCTV.

684
00:56:31,636 --> 00:56:33,636
What floor did Suh get off on?

685
00:56:34,006 --> 00:56:34,965
8th floor?

686
00:56:35,296 --> 00:56:37,426
The 9th floor. I'll start looking there.

687
00:56:44,426 --> 00:56:46,546
You're in great shape for your age.

688
00:56:47,136 --> 00:56:49,176
The way you slid back there was so cool.

689
00:56:49,386 --> 00:56:50,835
You were so fast.

690
00:56:51,256 --> 00:56:53,216
How could Suh have known?

691
00:56:54,676 --> 00:56:56,136
The things he said in the elevator,

692
00:56:56,256 --> 00:56:58,256
as if he'd watched what we'd done.

693
00:57:00,426 --> 00:57:01,426
You're right.

694
00:57:02,336 --> 00:57:04,546
Is he watching CCTVs like us?

695
00:57:06,546 --> 00:57:10,466
If Suh can see through the eyes of the infected...

696
00:57:11,966 --> 00:57:13,006
Hold on, then...

697
00:57:13,966 --> 00:57:15,835
Whatever these monsters see,

698
00:57:16,546 --> 00:57:18,296
Suh can see the same thing?

699
00:57:18,506 --> 00:57:20,386
He sees the same thing? What the hell?

700
00:57:20,506 --> 00:57:21,506
I found him!

701
00:57:27,336 --> 00:57:29,216
Where's that bastard going?

702
00:57:53,716 --> 00:57:54,926
What's he doing?

703
00:57:59,426 --> 00:58:00,885
Where is he going?

704
00:58:02,966 --> 00:58:04,636
It seems he's searching for something.

705
00:58:05,136 --> 00:58:06,386
He stopped.

706
00:58:06,966 --> 00:58:08,336
Where is that?

707
00:58:08,676 --> 00:58:12,926
3rd Floor, Building A Hallway...

708
00:58:14,296 --> 00:58:15,426
Bro!

709
00:58:17,426 --> 00:58:20,216
You locked me up, so I had a hard time finding you.

710
00:58:26,176 --> 00:58:27,466
Oh, that's...

711
00:58:27,586 --> 00:58:29,426
CEO Kang Woo-cheol.

712
00:58:29,426 --> 00:58:30,386
Huh?

713
00:58:30,466 --> 00:58:32,546
The first person Suh met.

714
00:58:34,216 --> 00:58:37,296
He was probably the first infected.

715
00:58:44,426 --> 00:58:46,755
See, wasn't I right?

716
00:58:49,336 --> 00:58:52,546
I said you'd be my link to the new humanity.

717
00:58:52,966 --> 00:58:54,466
So hurry up and bite me.

718
00:59:05,835 --> 00:59:07,676
Wait, did he just bite him?

719
00:59:08,386 --> 00:59:09,176
What's happening to him?

720
00:59:23,836 --> 00:59:24,795
Look at them.

721
00:59:43,086 --> 00:59:44,755
I'm not sure what it is,

722
00:59:45,466 --> 00:59:47,046
but they must be receiving some

723
00:59:47,086 --> 00:59:48,926
completely new sort of information.

724
00:59:50,926 --> 00:59:54,836
What is it? Is it connected to Suh being bitten?

725
00:59:54,926 --> 00:59:56,676
I have no idea.

726
00:59:57,466 --> 01:00:00,546
Then how long will they be in this condition?

727
01:00:00,966 --> 01:00:02,796
Before, they were like that for several minutes.

728
01:00:02,796 --> 01:00:04,586
There's no way to know.

729
01:00:06,216 --> 01:00:07,926
Okay, this is our chance.

730
01:00:08,046 --> 01:00:10,836
While they're in that state, we should go get the vaccine.

731
01:00:11,256 --> 01:00:13,506
He's on the 3rd floor, it won't take long.

732
01:00:15,386 --> 01:00:18,046
I'll watch the CCTV from here

733
01:00:18,176 --> 01:00:20,676
and tell you where it's safe, through the group chat.

734
01:00:20,886 --> 01:00:23,336
What you?

735
01:00:25,506 --> 01:00:26,546
You're going to stay here?

736
01:00:26,546 --> 01:00:28,176
Get the vaccine and come back.

737
01:00:28,216 --> 01:00:30,426
Until then, I'll tell you where to go.

738
01:00:30,716 --> 01:00:32,676
How can I leave you behind?

739
01:00:33,256 --> 01:00:36,336
Listen to me. This is the safest way.

740
01:00:37,386 --> 01:00:38,546
Yes, let's do that.

741
01:00:38,636 --> 01:00:41,546
We don't know when they'll wake up, so let's hurry.

742
01:01:32,546 --> 01:01:35,046
Let's drag him to someplace safe.

743
01:01:41,006 --> 01:01:44,006
What's going on?

744
01:01:51,006 --> 01:01:51,926
Go, quick!

745
01:01:52,756 --> 01:01:54,296
Hurry! Run!

746
01:02:00,756 --> 01:02:02,216
Hurry! Get inside!

747
01:02:02,506 --> 01:02:03,546
Hurry!

748
01:02:07,586 --> 01:02:09,546
What is this freak doing?

749
01:02:12,256 --> 01:02:14,136
They're leaving.

750
01:02:44,886 --> 01:02:46,176
Go that way.

751
01:02:52,336 --> 01:02:53,586
This way, quickly!

752
01:03:15,336 --> 01:03:16,586
They're gone.

753
01:03:17,546 --> 01:03:19,216
What the hell did you do?

754
01:03:22,756 --> 01:03:26,426
Ah, did you only pretend to go out? You're smart.

755
01:03:27,336 --> 01:03:29,216
You think if you cover my eyes,

756
01:03:29,216 --> 01:03:31,677
you'll be able to get out of here alive?

757
01:03:31,756 --> 01:03:33,176
What's this freak yammering about?

758
01:03:34,086 --> 01:03:36,046
Since getting bitten by Kang Woo-cheol,

759
01:03:36,086 --> 01:03:38,176
it seems he can communicate with all of them.

760
01:03:38,587 --> 01:03:39,756
Wait, then...

761
01:03:40,216 --> 01:03:44,216
that means he can control all those monsters out there.

762
01:03:45,546 --> 01:03:47,717
Let's only communicate by texting.

763
01:03:47,756 --> 01:03:49,926
Don't let him see or hear anything.

764
01:04:04,006 --> 01:04:07,006
But didn't we file all of our reports already?

765
01:04:07,466 --> 01:04:09,677
Why are they calling us to the Counterterrorism HQ?

766
01:04:09,717 --> 01:04:11,966
We'll see when we get there.

767
01:04:36,506 --> 01:04:38,547
From office go straight to emergency exit.

768
01:04:39,466 --> 01:04:40,507
Up stairs to 4th floor, to machine room.

769
01:04:44,637 --> 01:04:45,796
Let's hurry.

770
01:05:08,966 --> 01:05:10,046
Wait a minute.

771
01:05:12,256 --> 01:05:15,296
We're going back to where we started.

772
01:05:16,386 --> 01:05:17,587
That's right. Why?

773
01:05:18,637 --> 01:05:20,086
We need to pick up my sister.

774
01:05:20,136 --> 01:05:23,296
But now we can get out with the vaccine.

775
01:05:23,637 --> 01:05:24,796
Oh, that's right.

776
01:05:25,046 --> 01:05:27,426
This way, there's an elevator to the roof.

777
01:05:27,587 --> 01:05:29,256
What's going on?

778
01:05:29,336 --> 01:05:30,296
SECURITY

779
01:05:30,296 --> 01:05:32,296
What are you suggesting here?

780
01:05:32,336 --> 01:05:34,467
But now we just need to go up.

781
01:05:34,507 --> 01:05:36,296
You expect us to go back to the control room?

782
01:06:11,637 --> 01:06:14,296
Control Room

783
01:06:29,886 --> 01:06:30,966
What the hell?

784
01:06:31,006 --> 01:06:31,796
Hey!

785
01:06:32,006 --> 01:06:33,966
What do you think you're doing?

786
01:06:34,467 --> 01:06:35,467
-You... What?

787
01:06:35,507 --> 01:06:36,467
What did you do?

788
01:06:36,507 --> 01:06:37,547
Stop it.

789
01:06:37,717 --> 01:06:39,427
Make it fucking stop!

790
01:06:41,427 --> 01:06:42,836
I can't let this bastard go.

791
01:06:42,886 --> 01:06:45,836
I'm taking him with me. You, follow me!

792
01:06:46,717 --> 01:06:47,717
Come on!

793
01:06:47,966 --> 01:06:49,427
What are you doing?

794
01:06:49,547 --> 01:06:50,836
Are you crazy?

795
01:06:51,507 --> 01:06:53,176
Don't touch that vaccine!

796
01:06:56,507 --> 01:06:59,717
I'm sorry, but give up on your sister.

797
01:07:00,547 --> 01:07:01,427
It's too late.

798
01:07:32,256 --> 01:07:34,427
Hyun-seok

799
01:07:37,966 --> 01:07:39,717
Until he brings back his sister,

800
01:07:39,796 --> 01:07:41,176
we're going to wait here.

801
01:07:41,216 --> 01:07:42,427
Got it?

802
01:07:56,507 --> 01:07:57,926
Everyone listen up.

803
01:07:58,086 --> 01:08:01,467
This vaccine here is more important than anyone.

804
01:08:01,886 --> 01:08:03,926
This is for the whole world, okay?

805
01:08:09,086 --> 01:08:12,427
If you want to live, lead the way.

806
01:08:13,547 --> 01:08:14,717
Now!

807
01:08:29,256 --> 01:08:30,507
Hyun-seok!

808
01:08:30,756 --> 01:08:33,176
Are you okay? I'm going to you now.

809
01:08:33,176 --> 01:08:35,926
Which way is safe to go?

810
01:08:38,086 --> 01:08:39,836
Which way should I go?

811
01:08:40,836 --> 01:08:42,176
Hyun-hee!

812
01:08:44,507 --> 01:08:44,886
Um...

813
01:08:45,427 --> 01:08:47,587
Keep going straight ahead,

814
01:08:47,637 --> 01:08:49,086
and turn right.

815
01:08:52,136 --> 01:08:53,216
Okay, then what?

816
01:08:54,886 --> 01:08:56,677
This time, go left.

817
01:09:01,756 --> 01:09:03,677
Go straight, then take the stairs on the right.

818
01:09:03,836 --> 01:09:05,637
No no, stairs on the left!

819
01:09:05,756 --> 01:09:06,677
The left?

820
01:09:06,756 --> 01:09:07,677
Here? Is this right?

821
01:09:07,677 --> 01:09:08,387
Yeah.

822
01:09:08,387 --> 01:09:09,926
Go up those.

823
01:09:11,966 --> 01:09:13,297
Okay, I'm here.

824
01:09:13,547 --> 01:09:15,677
Go out the door and take the elevator.

825
01:09:15,717 --> 01:09:17,507
Here it is!

826
01:09:18,086 --> 01:09:19,176
I'm here!

827
01:09:19,176 --> 01:09:20,427
Are you okay?

828
01:09:24,387 --> 01:09:26,046
Hyun-hee, you made a mistake,

829
01:09:26,086 --> 01:09:28,637
this elevator doesn't go to the basement.

830
01:09:28,966 --> 01:09:30,926
You're all set now. Press the 4th floor.

831
01:09:31,547 --> 01:09:33,717
