You sent this invitation, didn't you?

1107
01:36:28,428 --> 01:36:31,178
My inspiration to create these children

1108
01:36:31,178 --> 01:36:33,388
came from you, Professor Kwon.

1109
01:36:36,838 --> 01:36:39,838
My dad begged you.

1110
01:36:44,589 --> 01:36:46,048
To Prof. Kwon: Imperfect communication,

1111
01:36:46,088 --> 01:36:47,048
the source of all tragedy

1112
01:36:47,048 --> 01:36:48,888
Se-jeong, this is a misunderstanding.

1113
01:36:48,968 --> 01:36:51,589
The law doesn't always match the actual situation.

1114
01:36:52,218 --> 01:36:54,719
Borrowing the name of students who didn't take part

1115
01:36:54,888 --> 01:36:58,138
was the only way to pay students who did participate.

1116
01:36:58,388 --> 01:37:00,138
They all agreed to it.

1117
01:37:00,388 --> 01:37:02,758
No, no, Se-jeong...

1118
01:37:02,758 --> 01:37:06,679
This is a tragedy resulting from imperfect communication.

1119
01:37:07,758 --> 01:37:08,798
No, please.

1120
01:37:09,138 --> 01:37:10,548
Se-jeong... Se-jeong?

1121
01:37:25,388 --> 01:37:28,589
And so, all of this was because of that incident?

1122
01:37:29,888 --> 01:37:32,138
If you want revenge, take it out on me, asshole!

1123
01:37:33,088 --> 01:37:34,298
What
What revenge?

1124
01:37:35,639 --> 01:37:37,589
My dad's death

1125
01:37:39,589 --> 01:37:42,508
was a tragedy caused by imperfect communication.

1126
01:37:43,088 --> 01:37:45,218
Not because of someone like you.

1127
01:37:45,218 --> 01:37:48,679
Like you... like you...

1128
01:37:50,758 --> 01:37:53,388
Compared to the great achievements of mankind,

1129
01:37:53,549 --> 01:37:54,719
the knowledge possessed

1130
01:37:54,719 --> 01:37:56,798
by any individual is incredibly limited.

1131
01:37:57,388 --> 01:38:02,048
That limitation creates a state of terrible incomprehension.

1132
01:38:03,088 --> 01:38:05,928
In the end, the way to stop all such tragedies

1133
01:38:06,298 --> 01:38:10,639
is to connect all of our minds together.

1134
01:38:12,218 --> 01:38:14,719
The imperfect communication of human beings,

1135
01:38:15,088 --> 01:38:16,928
all the tragedies that result from

1136
01:38:16,968 --> 01:38:19,218
not fully understanding what others feel.

1137
01:38:19,968 --> 01:38:22,218
This system is the perfect solution.

1138
01:38:23,298 --> 01:38:25,298
That's what we are.

1139
01:38:27,509 --> 01:38:31,679
What do less evolved beings like you have over us?

1140
01:38:32,679 --> 01:38:33,798
Ah ...

1141
01:38:34,639 --> 01:38:36,679
The freedom to be an outcast?

1142
01:38:38,258 --> 01:38:40,388
Can you handle that, Professor?

1143
01:38:41,968 --> 01:38:44,048
You do this because you can handle it?

1144
01:38:45,218 --> 01:38:47,428
Then go ahead, be an outcast.

1145
01:38:58,088 --> 01:38:59,719
Alpha Team, target located.

1146
01:39:11,549 --> 01:39:13,798
Alpha Team, vaccine secured! Vaccine secured!

1147
01:39:14,088 --> 01:39:16,048
If target's secured, withdraw quickly!

1148
01:39:47,469 --> 01:39:50,888
Well, it's a shame, but at least we've got the vaccine...

1149
01:39:53,258 --> 01:39:54,798
Then what about her?

1150
01:39:55,338 --> 01:39:57,298
You're just going to abandon her?

1151
01:39:57,719 --> 01:40:00,048
Send the rescue team back in now!

1152
01:40:00,509 --> 01:40:01,968
Okay, everyone...

1153
01:40:02,088 --> 01:40:04,138
Professor, get some rest, okay?

1154
01:40:04,389 --> 01:40:06,178
think your job here is done.

1155
01:40:06,389 --> 01:40:08,838
Escort the professor out. Back to your places.

1156
01:40:08,928 --> 01:40:10,758
- This way, please. - Let go!

1157
01:40:13,338 --> 01:40:15,549
Alpha Team moving to Building C Rooftop.

1158
01:40:15,549 --> 01:40:18,258
Roger. Charlie Team ready to move to adjacent building.

1159
01:40:34,218 --> 01:40:37,389
My Better Half

1160
01:40:41,509 --> 01:40:42,798
Hello?

1161
01:40:43,008 --> 01:40:46,469
Hello? Professor Kwon? Are you okay?

1162
01:40:47,679 --> 01:40:50,298
I know your situation there.

1163
01:40:50,639 --> 01:40:52,218
You know my situation?

1164
01:40:53,088 --> 01:40:57,008
I was watching from the Counterterrorism HQ.

1165
01:40:57,928 --> 01:40:59,008
I'm sorry.

1166
01:40:59,549 --> 01:41:02,509
I don't think the rescue team can go back.

1167
01:41:05,389 --> 01:41:08,088
Then why are you calling me?

1168
01:41:10,549 --> 01:41:13,298
I thought I had found a way to stop the infected.

1169
01:41:13,888 --> 01:41:17,218
There was a group of monkeys Suh experimented on at his lab.

1170
01:41:17,389 --> 01:41:20,008
When a monkey marked

1171
01:41:20,178 --> 01:41:22,719
all the other monkeys stopped moving.

1172
01:41:22,838 --> 01:41:23,838
They stopped moving?

1173
01:41:24,429 --> 01:41:26,838
So I thought killing the first infected

1174
01:41:26,838 --> 01:41:28,469
would solve everything...

1175
01:41:36,429 --> 01:41:38,138
The monkey marked

1176
01:41:38,339 --> 01:41:40,469
It's not the first one to be infected.

1177
01:41:40,719 --> 01:41:42,928
It's the monkey that controls all the others.

1178
01:41:43,088 --> 01:41:45,339
In that case, monkey

1179
01:41:46,339 --> 01:41:48,088
Suh Young-chul himself.

1180
01:41:48,679 --> 01:41:51,008
Alpha Team arriving at destination.

1181
01:41:51,218 --> 01:41:52,838
Have you ever been shot?

1182
01:41:53,679 --> 01:41:54,838
Eyes forward.

1183
01:42:16,589 --> 01:42:18,259
I'm so sore.

1184
01:42:39,838 --> 01:42:41,639
Tell them to kill Suh Young-chul immediately.

1185
01:42:41,639 --> 01:42:44,259
That'll stop all of them from moving.

1186
01:42:44,679 --> 01:42:47,048
If Suh gets outside, we're finished!

1187
01:42:48,048 --> 01:42:50,968
We can't. If we kill him now,

1188
01:42:51,339 --> 01:42:53,429
not only the victims' families,

1189
01:42:53,798 --> 01:42:55,968
but everyone scared of getting infected

1190
01:42:55,968 --> 01:42:57,339
will become our enemies.

1191
01:42:57,389 --> 01:42:59,838
The government won't easily make that decision.

1192
01:43:00,928 --> 01:43:02,758
Can you handle that?

1193
01:43:03,259 --> 01:43:05,639
Then go ahead, be an outcast.

1194
01:43:07,679 --> 01:43:09,339
So that's what he meant.

1195
01:43:25,219 --> 01:43:27,048
Is he really the vaccine?

1196
01:43:28,008 --> 01:43:31,299
Never mind what others think, what do you think?

1197
01:43:34,088 --> 01:43:35,968
You have to decide.

1198
01:43:51,719 --> 01:43:54,469
Any issues bringing Suh Young-chul outside?

1199
01:43:54,888 --> 01:43:57,928
No, Suh Young-chul is coming out safely.

1200
01:44:06,968 --> 01:44:08,679
We need to eliminate Suh Young-chul!

1201
01:44:09,549 --> 01:44:10,968
What are you talking about?

1202
01:44:11,219 --> 01:44:13,469
I called Professor Kwon who's in the building now,

1203
01:44:13,639 --> 01:44:16,798
and she said Suh is controlling all of the infected.

1204
01:44:16,798 --> 01:44:17,888
Suh Young-chul is

1205
01:44:17,968 --> 01:44:19,509
We need to kill him.

1206
01:44:19,968 --> 01:44:22,589
Seriously? Kill the vaccine?

1207
01:44:24,339 --> 01:44:25,968
Your responsibility extends only

1208
01:44:26,008 --> 01:44:28,008
to that operation that failed earlier!

1209
01:44:28,299 --> 01:44:30,259
Does anyone have clear evidence

1210
01:44:30,259 --> 01:44:32,549
that we need to kill our only vaccine?

1211
01:44:32,589 --> 01:44:34,048
Anyone? Anyone have it?

1212
01:44:36,469 --> 01:44:40,389
The vaccine is on his way here now. It's all finished!

1213
01:44:42,928 --> 01:44:45,838
HQ, lifting lockdown here. One SWAT vehicle moving.

1214
01:44:45,838 --> 01:44:47,679
The vaccine is being moved to the safe zone.

1215
01:44:48,968 --> 01:44:51,838
HQ, vehicle has entered! I repeat, vehicle has entered!

1216
01:44:58,838 --> 01:45:00,469
Too many people are gathered in front

1217
01:45:00,509 --> 01:45:02,299
of Doongwoori Building. Support needed.

1218
01:45:02,639 --> 01:45:04,339
Requesting all available personnel

1219
01:45:04,339 --> 01:45:06,139
to be sent to Doongwoori Building.

1220
01:47:00,969 --> 01:47:03,339
Secure the area! Move back!

1221
01:47:03,888 --> 01:47:05,509
Stop, please. Move back.

1222
01:47:05,639 --> 01:47:07,259
Move back, move back!

1223
01:47:41,758 --> 01:47:43,299
Minister!

1224
01:47:48,888 --> 01:47:50,139
The barricade in front of

1225
01:47:50,139 --> 01:47:52,089
Doongwoori Building is being breached!

1226
01:47:52,339 --> 01:47:53,549
What?

1227
01:48:20,469 --> 01:48:21,719
Come on.

1228
01:48:28,389 --> 01:48:31,089
No... we need to get Suh.

1229
01:48:31,219 --> 01:48:33,009
Where are the nearest army units?

1230
01:48:33,758 --> 01:48:37,549
All the troops in Seoul are mobilized in there.

1231
01:48:39,049 --> 01:48:40,139
Damn it!

1232
01:48:40,389 --> 01:48:43,639
Listen, everyone. Let's disband for now, okay?

1233
01:48:43,679 --> 01:48:46,179
We'll decide the HQ's new location later.

1234
01:48:46,219 --> 01:48:48,049
Everyone evacuate, quickly!

1235
01:49:28,089 --> 01:49:29,179
Hello?

1236
01:49:29,509 --> 01:49:31,339
What happened to Suh?

1237
01:49:32,049 --> 01:49:34,429
The people in charge here are all running away.

1238
01:49:34,679 --> 01:49:36,429
And Suh Young-chul escaped.

1239
01:49:38,009 --> 01:49:41,049
Can you check Suh's location? You said you saw everything.

1240
01:49:41,139 --> 01:49:43,549
Just a minute. I'll call you right back.

1241
01:49:44,889 --> 01:49:46,049
Professor Gong.

1242
01:49:46,758 --> 01:49:47,969
Professor Gong!

1243
01:49:58,758 --> 01:50:00,219
Do we know Suh's location?

1244
01:50:00,259 --> 01:50:01,179
What?

1245
01:50:01,509 --> 01:50:02,929
What are you doing?

1246
01:50:03,219 --> 01:50:04,299
You need to evacuate!

1247
01:50:04,549 --> 01:50:06,299
There's no time! Go, quickly!

1248
01:50:18,889 --> 01:50:20,089
I found him.

1249
01:50:20,969 --> 01:50:22,929
He's at 32 Sinsok Street, on the main road.

1250
01:50:26,589 --> 01:50:28,429
See the car with blinking lights?

1251
01:50:28,889 --> 01:50:29,839
see it.

1252
01:50:29,889 --> 01:50:31,049
I'm watching.

1253
01:50:34,009 --> 01:50:35,679
Tell me which way to go.

1254
01:50:42,839 --> 01:50:44,009
Keep going straight.

1255
01:50:44,009 --> 01:50:44,549
Keep going straight. Jalan terus

1256
01:50:46,509 --> 01:50:48,089
Left at the intersection.

1257
01:50:54,049 --> 01:50:55,429
Turn right at the next intersection.

1258
01:53:04,089 --> 01:53:05,969
That idiot, covering himself in that...

1259
01:53:13,339 --> 01:53:14,429
Move!

1260
01:53:16,969 --> 01:53:19,049
Out of the way!

1261
01:53:45,009 --> 01:53:46,259
reverted to their original state.

1262
01:54:32,889 --> 01:54:34,969
Stop! Stop, you bastards!

1263
01:54:35,590 --> 01:54:36,929
Stop!

1264
01:54:49,759 --> 01:54:51,799
Please stop!

1265
01:54:58,049 --> 01:54:58,889
Stop!

1266
01:54:59,259 --> 01:55:00,429
Please...

1267
01:56:49,009 --> 01:56:49,680
Yes?

1268
01:56:49,680 --> 01:56:51,929
How's it in other places? Was it successful?

1269
01:56:55,009 --> 01:56:56,590
They've stopped.

1270
01:56:58,049 --> 01:56:59,720
You did it.

1271
01:57:00,720 --> 01:57:03,470
I doubt people will see it that way.

1272
01:57:04,339 --> 01:57:05,799
What should we do?

1273
01:57:05,969 --> 01:57:08,139
The vaccine's gone for good now.

1274
01:57:08,139 --> 01:57:10,179
Everyone's going to hate me.

1275
01:57:11,550 --> 01:57:12,929
Don't worry.

1276
01:57:13,049 --> 01:57:15,550
I'll testify with you.

1277
01:57:16,049 --> 01:57:19,339
If you're going to be hated, I'll take it with you.

1278
01:57:25,139 --> 01:57:26,969
No need for that.

1279
01:57:27,139 --> 01:57:28,889
I'm used to people hating me.

1280
01:57:30,929 --> 01:57:32,640
Where are you now?

1281
01:57:33,929 --> 01:57:36,510
I guess we have a lot of work ahead of us.

1282
01:58:05,016 --> 01:58:22,142
translated and adapted by - AnnaV

